Which of the following is the largest population to which the results of the study can be generalized?', NULL, '["All trivia teams in the tournament that scored 14 or more points in the round", "The 55 trivia teams in the sample", "The 40 trivia teams in the sample that practiced for at least 3 hours per week", "All trivia teams in the tournament"]', 3, 'The correct answer is D. This question requires understanding of evaluating statistical claims concepts.', 'This question tests your understanding of Evaluating Statistical Claims. Problem-Solving and Data Analysis is one of the key content domains on the SAT.', 'Practice more Evaluating Statistical Claims problems to strengthen your skills in this area.', 1, 120, '[]');
INSERT INTO questions (id, section, module, topic, subtopic, difficulty, question_text, passage_text, options, correct_index, explain_why, explain_concept, explain_next, is_calculator_allowed, est_time_sec, tags) VALUES (231, 'math', 1, 'problem_solving', 'statistical_claims', 'medium', 'A psychologist designed and conducted a study to determine whether
playing a certain educational game increases middle school students''
accuracy in adding fractions. For the study, the psychologist chose a
random sample of 35 students from all of the students at one of the middle
schools in a large city. The psychologist found that students who played the
game showed significant improvement in accuracy when adding fractions.
