10', NULL, '["37 10", "33 10", "10", "7"]', 3, 'The correct answer is D. This question requires understanding of probability concepts.', 'This question tests your understanding of Probability. Problem-Solving and Data Analysis is one of the key content domains on the SAT.', 'Practice more Probability problems to strengthen your skills in this area.', 1, 120, '[]');
