selected was an MTN subscriber is 0.43. There were p million MTN
subscribers in Nigeria on September 30, 2015. To the nearest integer, what
is the value of p ?', NULL, '["42", "0", "1", "-1"]', 0, 'The correct answer is 42. This is a student-produced response question testing probability.', 'This question tests your understanding of Probability. Problem-Solving and Data Analysis is one of the key content domains on the SAT.', 'Practice more Probability problems to strengthen your skills in this area.', 1, 120, '["student_produced_response"]');
