character Valia is reading is nearly silent:', '["\"The hand in which he carried his book was getting stiff with cold, but he would not ask his mother to take the book from him.\"", "\"Valia was reading a huge, very huge book, almost half as large as himself.\"", "\"Valia approached the window and examined the toys.\"", "\"Everything in the room was quiet, so quiet that the only thing to be heard was the rustling of the pages he turned.\""]', 3, 'The correct answer is D. This question requires understanding of command of evidence concepts.', 'This question tests your understanding of Command of Evidence. Information and Ideas is one of the key content domains on the SAT.', 'Practice more Command of Evidence problems to strengthen your skills in this area.', 0, 90, '[]');
