invasive predator species have harmfully impacted threatened birds, mammals, and reptiles. In the table, higher numbers
represent greater impacts. The estimated impact of invasive mongooses on threatened mammals is', '["0.35.", "0.61.", "0.75;", "0.52."]', 2, 'The correct answer is C. This question requires understanding of command of evidence concepts.', 'This question tests your understanding of Command of Evidence. Information and Ideas is one of the key content domains on the SAT.', 'Practice more Command of Evidence problems to strengthen your skills in this area.', 0, 90, '[]');
