directly, have not fully understood themselves, writing,', '["\"You have not known what you are, you have slumber''d upon yourself / all your life, / Your eyelids have been the same as closed most of the time.\"", "\"These immense meadows, these interminable rivers, you are immense / and interminable as they.\"", "\"| should have made my way straight to you long ago, / | should have blabb''d nothing but you, | should have chanted nothing / but you.\"", "\"I will leave all and come and make the hymns of you, / None has understood you, but | understand you.\""]', 0, 'The correct answer is A. This question requires understanding of command of evidence concepts.', 'This question tests your understanding of Command of Evidence. Information and Ideas is one of the key content domains on the SAT.', 'Practice more Command of Evidence problems to strengthen your skills in this area.', 0, 90, '[]');
