and how tall each pyramid is. Consulting the table, the student finds that el Castillo was built 1,100 to 1,400 years ago and is', '["33 meters tall.", "47 meters tall.", "40 meters tall.", "60 meters tall."]', 2, 'The correct answer is C. This question requires understanding of command of evidence concepts.', 'This question tests your understanding of Command of Evidence. Information and Ideas is one of the key content domains on the SAT.', 'Practice more Command of Evidence problems to strengthen your skills in this area.', 0, 90, '[]');
