one has just been introduced is almost unbearable.', '["Regret", "Persist", "Tolerate", "Encourage"]', 2, 'The correct answer is C. This question requires understanding of words in context concepts.', 'This question tests your understanding of Words in Context. Craft and Structure is one of the key content domains on the SAT.', 'Practice more Words in Context problems to strengthen your skills in this area.', 0, 90, '[]');
INSERT INTO questions (id, section, module, topic, subtopic, difficulty, question_text, passage_text, options, correct_index, explain_why, explain_concept, explain_next, is_calculator_allowed, est_time_sec, tags) VALUES (891, 'reading_writing', 2, 'craft_structure', 'words_context', 'hard', 'Which choice completes the text with the most logical and precise word or phrase?', 'Scholarly discussions of gender in Shakespeare''s comedies often celebrate the rebellion of the playwright''s
