equation by 6 yields x = 6 . Therefore, the lines represented by these equ', 'This is a College Board practice test question. Review the official explanation for detailed analysis.', 'Work through more practice test questions in this section to build familiarity with the test format.', 1, 120, '["figure_required"]');
